# Source-vs-runtime boundary: this repo carries skill source only.
# `.orch-lite/` is live CLI state of whichever project the skill runs in (the
# dot prefix marks it tool-managed runtime), `.worktrees/` are child write
# areas destroyed at T2 — tracking either ships one machine's runtime as source.
# `multi-agent/` stays ignored during the rename transition: older installs and
# pre-migration checkouts still carry it; drop this line once no legacy dir
# remains anywhere the skill runs.
multi-agent/
.orch-lite/
.worktrees/
